          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Reduce the risk of injury when repositioning patients</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"standalone-link\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Now more than ever, healthcare workers deserve to be protected when caring for patients. Our innovative Turn and Position (TAP) products provide a safe way to reposition patients and address the risk factors that can lead to pressure injury.</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 04 2021 19:58:35 GMT+0000",
